<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Asset Maintenance & Reliability</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Protect your production capacity through proactive industrial stewardship—minimizing 
            unplanned downtime through structured maintenance and technical governance.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Preventive Maintenance Scheduling</h2>
        <p>
            Transition from reactive repair to proactive reliability. The Maintenance module 
            allows for the creation of automated service schedules for every critical asset 
            on the factory floor—based on calendar frequency, run-time hours, or 
            production cycles. Automated work orders are generated for the technical 
            team, ensuring that routine inspections and servicing are performed exactly 
            when needed, significantly extending the operational life of your 
            machinery.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Breakdown Management & Lifecycle</h2>
        <p>
            When technical failures occur, the system provides a high-standard response 
            framework. Operators log breakdowns directly from the shop floor terminal, 
            triggering immediate alerts to the engineering team. Repair logs capture 
            detailed technical observations, root-cause analysis, and parts consumed, 
            building a permanent health history for every piece of equipment.
        </p>
        <p>
            This historical data is a critical requirement for ISO 55001 asset management 
            compliance and provides the empirical basis for future equipment 
            procurement and decommissioning decisions.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Spare Parts & Technical Inventory</h2>
        <p>
            Maintain the continuity of your technical operations. The system manages a 
            dedicated inventory of critical spare parts, tracking stock levels and 
            associated costs. Integrating maintenance orders with inventory control 
            ensures that the parts needed for a service are reserved in advance, 
            preventing delays in critical repairs and optimizing the facility's 
            readiness for emergency technical incidents.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

